    <p>
      We compress only the lookup tables and evaluate 40 tasks across commonsense,
      knowledge, reading comprehension, multilingual understanding, and math and code.
      Removing the table shows how much each model relies on it; CP keeps most of that
      benefit at roughly a quarter to an eighth of the storage.
    </p>
